  "details": "The ability to move the chatbox input field has been reimplemented in 1914, but I find it pretty frustrating to have to aim at the input field to move them together. I want to be able to grab the keyboard as well to move them both.\n\nPlease give us the ability to \"lock\" the keyboard to the input field so that grabbing either the input field OR the keyboard results in moving both at the same time. This would honestly be helpful in the main menu as well. Once the keyboard has been positioned in a comfortable place I don't really want to move it or resize it.",
